# PC card pc-melee-strong (docs/bench/melee-top3.md, MGUN-24, BENCH-185): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 6 fresh seeds (3280-3285, after pc-melee-near's 3271-3278), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant; the bench drops the robots broken-1.11.2.txt lists (BENCH-169). Template: msprep writes work/melee-strong-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, k1, k2); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
--suite
melee-census-317.txt
--seeds
6
--seed-base
3279
--rounds
35
--parallel
@C@
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.Hadur_@V@@A@.jar
--robot
hadur117.Hadur @V@@A@
--out
work/melee-strong-@V@-@A@
--report
../docs/bench/local/melee-strong-@A@.md
